              </div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm">Message Delivery</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                Messages are split into packets, which may take different paths through the network. The internet does not require a direct connection between sender and receiver.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="vocab-card bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2">
